WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.017
Bot scanned the ground slowly.

2
00:00:05.018 --> 00:00:11.205
"Blue Moon is big," Ringo thought.

3
00:00:11.206 --> 00:00:16.577
"This will take a long time."

4
00:00:16.578 --> 00:00:19.529
Suddenly—

5
00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.809
zoom! PJ zipped past with

6
00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:26.317
Lucy. His scanner beeped and

7
00:00:26.318 --> 00:00:33.549
flashed. Ringo waved. "Hi,

8
00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:40.013
Lucy." Lucy frowned. "What a dumb

9
00:00:40.014 --> 00:00:44.822
mission! Finding the tool is

10
00:00:44.823 --> 00:00:49.284
impossible." "We could work together," Ringo

11
00:00:49.285 --> 00:00:59.095
said. "What?" Lucy laughed.

12
00:00:59.096 --> 00:01:10.315
"Never!" Lucy ran after

13
00:01:10.316 --> 00:01:18.907
PJ. Bot kept scanning the

14
00:01:18.908 --> 00:01:23.518
ground. Finally she stopped near some big

15
00:01:23.519 --> 00:01:29.179
rocks. Bot sighed. "Lucy is

16
00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:32.236
right. This is

17
00:01:32.237 --> 00:01:35.124
impossible." "We'll find the tool," Ringo

18
00:01:35.125 --> 00:01:37.446
said. "Let's—Ah-choo!"

19
00:01:37.447 --> 00:01:43.482
As Ringo sneezed, dust flew everywhere.

20
00:01:43.483 --> 00:01:47.310
"Bot!" Ringo stared at the rocks.

21
00:01:47.311 --> 00:01:50.255
"Shine light here!"

22
00:01:50.256 --> 00:01:54.471
Bot shined light on the rocks.

23
00:01:54.472 --> 00:01:57.432
"The tool!" Lucy cried.

24
00:01:57.433 --> 00:02:03.666
Lucy ran toward the rocks.

25
00:02:03.667 --> 00:02:08.963
Bot's long arm shot out—she grabbed the tool!

26
00:02:08.964 --> 00:02:15.727
"Let's go!" Ringo said.

27
00:02:15.728 --> 00:02:23.494
"Grr!" Lucy stomped her foot.

28
00:02:23.495 --> 00:02:27.440
At the base Commander Cosmo beamed.

29
00:02:27.441 --> 00:02:31.484
"My favorite wrench! Thank you, Ringo!"

30
00:02:31.485 --> 00:02:35.835
Ringo grinned. "I like wrenches too."

31
00:02:35.836 --> 00:02:39.182
"Good job, Ringo," Captain Nova said.

32
00:02:39.183 --> 00:02:42.806
Lucy frowned. "It was luck."

33
00:02:42.807 --> 00:02:46.408
"Nope." Ringo patted Bot.

34
00:02:46.409 --> 00:02:54.095
"It was teamwork!"

